WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.208
[Triumphant music]

00:00:02.208 --> 00:00:03.958
- [Grunting]

00:00:03.958 --> 00:00:06.750
I'm back...on...top!

00:00:10.083 --> 00:00:12.000
[Sun shuriken whirring]
[Splashing, sizzling]

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.125
- OK, you've had your shot. It's my time now.

00:00:15.125 --> 00:00:18.416
- Luka?! If anyone's taking the
MVP idol from Jokic,

00:00:18.416 --> 00:00:20.250
it's the winner of last year's one seed.
[Chiming]

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:23.291
- And how'd that work out for you? Huh?
[Fire igniting and water swirling]

00:00:23.291 --> 00:00:26.291
[Fire igniting and water swirling]
[Laughing]

00:00:26.291 --> 00:00:28.416
[Thundering]

00:00:28.416 --> 00:00:29.000
- Wow!

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:32.333
The wonders of this strange land
never cease to amaze!

00:00:33.416 --> 00:00:35.125
[Crashing]

00:00:37.125 --> 00:00:37.958
You guys coming?

00:00:39.458 --> 00:00:42.375
♪♪♪  Born to be a hero ♪♪♪

00:00:42.375 --> 00:00:45.625
♪♪♪  Riaru-sa misetayo ♪♪♪

00:00:45.625 --> 00:00:48.583
♪♪♪  Born to be a legend ♪♪♪

00:00:48.583 --> 00:00:51.833
♪♪♪  Hikari o mezashite ♪♪♪

00:00:51.833 --> 00:00:58.250
♪♪♪  Born to be a hero ♪♪♪

00:00:59.458 --> 00:01:00.750
[Steady footsteps]

00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:04.625
[Giannis:] Ah, man. Jokic does everything for 
1.6-Kilometer-High City.

00:01:04.625 --> 00:01:10.000
- This is why an elite fighter like you—
or me—must stop him from getting a third idol.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:12.125
- Oh. So you're on Giannis ' level now?

00:01:12.125 --> 00:01:14.125
- [Luka]: Hahaha. OK.

00:01:16.041 --> 00:01:19.291
[Whooshing]

00:01:19.291 --> 00:01:22.000
- This is the closest I've been to a real trophy.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:25.333
- Don’t! Jokic’s MVPs are rigged!
[Earth rumbling]

00:01:25.333 --> 00:01:27.916
- [Luka and Devin]: Ahh!
- [Giannis]: Whee!

00:01:29.541 --> 00:01:32.500
Oh. Another Giannis wall.

00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:34.083
[Dribbling]

00:01:34.083 --> 00:01:37.791
[Fire igniting]
- Point God, show me the way.

00:01:37.791 --> 00:01:39.333
[Quickening footfalls]
[Gasp] Chris?

00:01:39.333 --> 00:01:40.375
[Footfalls fading]

00:01:40.375 --> 00:01:42.041
[Sigh] Deandre?

00:01:42.041 --> 00:01:45.875
[Water dripping]
- Ah, well. I am used to being alone.

00:01:45.875 --> 00:01:48.750
- [Menacing laughing]
- He's...here.

00:01:49.041 --> 00:01:50.375
[Striking dynamite fuse]
- Hello.

00:01:50.375 --> 00:01:50.958
- [Screaming]

00:01:53.208 --> 00:01:54.875
- Here we go.
[Hook whirring]

00:01:58.375 --> 00:02:01.416
[Steady footsteps]

00:02:01.416 --> 00:02:04.000
- Stop hiding the MVP away in the mountains!

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:07.125
It belongs in a bigger market!

00:02:07.583 --> 00:02:09.625
- Are we really doubling in open combat?

00:02:09.625 --> 00:02:11.916
- Almost ready.
[Hook still whirring]

00:02:12.458 --> 00:02:15.625
- I have many weapons in my arsenal.

00:02:15.625 --> 00:02:18.375
[Dynamite sizzling and exploding]

00:02:20.291 --> 00:02:21.708
[Warping]

00:02:21.708 --> 00:02:24.416
- Ow! In the back? Who does that?

00:02:27.416 --> 00:02:29.875
[Brand sizzling]

00:02:29.875 --> 00:02:31.208
- Wet.

00:02:32.041 --> 00:02:32.833
[Hammer thudding]

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:38.000
[To himself] He can sense where I am without looking. 

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:39.750
I don't know if I can beat him without help.

00:02:39.750 --> 00:02:43.000
[Earth bursting]
- [Powerful echoing] I am here for the idol.

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:45.458
Aye, man. This place is very nice!

00:02:49.416 --> 00:02:52.250
[Water swirling]
- Ahhh!

00:02:52.250 --> 00:02:55.000
- I will not be cooled off!

00:02:55.833 --> 00:02:56.666
[Hammer thuds]

00:02:57.250 --> 00:02:58.583
[Bursting]

00:02:59.416 --> 00:03:01.000
- Goodbye!

00:03:02.833 --> 00:03:06.708
- You had one job, Joker.
The Association's displeased.

00:03:06.708 --> 00:03:08.291
[Nuggets whooshing]

00:03:08.291 --> 00:03:11.041
[Chuckling] You know I live online.

00:03:12.416 --> 00:03:20.333
Channel your rage at stopping these targets.
[Suspenseful music]

00:03:20.333 --> 00:03:22.166
- Hmm.

00:03:22.583 --> 00:03:25.541
[Joyful, playful music]

